<Project>
    <!--
        Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk.Web is Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web with LaunchPad. A project swaps the one for the other and changes nothing else:

            <Project Sdk="Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk.Web">

        with the version under msbuild-sdks in global.json, or in the attribute (Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk.Web/1.2.3). It is the same as Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web with
        <Sdk Name="Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk" /> next to it.

        ASP.NET Core applications. Dovetail detects a WebApplication host, and LaunchPad adds Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Hosting,
        Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.AspNetCore and, unless the project sets PublishAot or IsAotCompatible, Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.AspNetCore.Mvc.

        It chains Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk.Web, Dovetail's mirror of Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web, which imports the Microsoft SDK and then Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk, and then
        applies what every LaunchPad SDK applies (Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Mirror.props). Under a Directory.Build.props that already applies
        Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk or a LaunchPad SDK, neither is applied a second time.
    -->

    <!--
        The versions of the packages the SDK adds and of the Dovetail and Chirograph SDKs it chains, generated when the SDK is packed. The version of the
        import wins over a Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk.Web entry in global.json. It is read before the Microsoft SDK imports the Directory.Build.props, so to
        chain another version set LaunchPadDovetailSdkVersion as a global property or an environment variable
        (dotnet build -p:LaunchPadDovetailSdkVersion=1.2.3). Sdk.targets imports the same version, whatever the project sets in between.
    -->
    <Import Project="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)Packages.props" />
    <PropertyGroup>
        <_LaunchPadMirrorDovetailSdkVersion>$(LaunchPadDovetailSdkVersion)</_LaunchPadMirrorDovetailSdkVersion>
    </PropertyGroup>
    <Import Project="Sdk.props" Sdk="Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk.Web" Version="$(_LaunchPadMirrorDovetailSdkVersion)" />
    <Import Project="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Mirror.props" />
</Project>
